From: Bastiaan van der Plaat <bastiaan.v.d.plaat@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 22:18:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add the DS Rumble Pak

A Rumble Pak in the GBA slot rumbles through I_Tactile, which Doom
already called when the player takes damage, and now also when firing a
weapon. The pak only moves while it is switched back and forth, a tick
task does that at 60 Hz for as long as the rumble lasts. Without a pak,
and on the DSi which has no GBA slot, nothing changes. The demos playing
behind the menu don't rumble.

Options always shows Rumble On/Off below Messages, kept as rumble in
the config, it rumbles once turned on. There is no menu graphic for
Rumble, so it is cut from the letters of others: the R of Read This!,
the u, m, l and e of Sound Volume, the colon of Messages: and a b made
of the top of the r of rough, its stem filling the notch, and the
bottom of the d of Load. Graphics of other sizes than id's are not cut
up, those get Rumble in the HUD font.
